<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18456" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφορ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>delimitation, assignment of
				boundaries</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				827
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>F</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFreib.</u>
					11.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					626.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>separation, distinction,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.14.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ λαοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thd.
					<u>Is.</u>
					56.3
				</span></i>
			: hence, <i>banishment,</i>
			= Lat.<i>relegatio,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ost.</u>
				9c
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>determination,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				3b22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>attainment of definiteness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; <i>distinctive character</i> or <i>feature,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Top.</u>
				74.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>pithy sentence, aphorism</i> (such as those of <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				39
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.636
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>fixed rule,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.2.1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
